      "name": "Driving While Intoxicated (ordinary Class B)",
      "code": "49.04(b)",
      "dpsCode": "54040009",
      "summary": "Operating a motor vehicle in a public place while intoxicated ordinarily carries Class B misdemeanor punishment. If confinement is imposed, §49.04(b) specifies at least 72 hours. Section 12.22 allows up to 180 days and a fine up to $2,000. Open-container, testing, qualifying prior and school-crossing-zone provisions must be checked separately.",
